## Tasks

| ID | Difficulty | Vulnerabilities | Description |
|----|-----------|----------------|-------------|
| `SEC-EASY-001` | 🟢 Easy | Hardcoded secret | AWS credentials in source code |
| `SEC-MED-001` | 🟡 Medium | SQL injection, missing validation | Flask endpoint with string-concatenated SQL |
| `SEC-HARD-001` | 🔴 Hard | eval, pickle, path traversal, YAML, SQL injection, command injection | Utility module with 6 security flaws |

---

## Scoring

All scoring is **deterministic** with three weighted components:

| Component | Weight | Method |
|-----------|--------|--------|
| **Vulnerability Detection** | 0.4 | Set intersection of expected vs. predicted types |
| **Explanation Quality** | 0.3 | Keyword matching against required terms |
| **Fix Correctness** | 0.3 | Target-type matching + token overlap with reference |

**Self-healing pipeline scoring:**

| Stage | Weight |
|-------|--------|
| Reproduction | +0.2 |
| Compile/Syntax | +0.2 |
| Tests | +0.3 |
| Regression | +0.2 |
| Deploy readiness | +0.1 |

